# Data given to a launch is read as it is (the author 2026-11-11, R12; plan M11 5a): `call: Made Step` does not execute
# the computed declaration of z in Made, so Step reads z without a value -- 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the call main().
fn: five () int
    return: 5
sub: main () (
    Step:
        int: z
        z := z + 1
    Made:
        int: z five() + 1
)
    call: Made Step
main()
int: realized main\data\Made\z
